 uninitialized variable'
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Root cause: CDN <script src> tags were not closed, so browser treated
inline JS as text content. RGBELoader, RoomEnvironment, GLTFLoader
never loaded. Voice input code was duplicated 3x but never executed.

Fix:
- Close all CDN script tags properly (</script>)
- Remove 3x duplicated voice input code → single copy
- Add initThree() retry in buildModel if scene/renderer missing
- Better error messages for Three.js failures
